**[+ centrum_leader +]** has converted the centrist parliamentary club into a party that
may contest the next election. [? if left_in_government: It is a separate
support caucus whose votes may matter to the cabinet; it has no ministry unless
a recorded reshuffle grants one.?][? if not left_in_government:
It is not Lewica's governing caucus; the available tools are parliamentary
coordination and list talks.?] Lewica can negotiate with it separately, offer
a broader common list to both centrist parties, or make it prove that it has
an electorate of its own.

