= October 2026 — More reports do not reveal the whole trend

Higher reports can mean more violence, greater willingness to report, or both.
A credible response needs victim trust, police classification, prosecution and
political rhetoric—not a claim that one number explains everything.

This crisis did not begin with the police spreadsheet. Its severity is **[+
hate_incident_severity_2026 +]/20**, after **[+ refugee_settlement +]**, **[+
asylum_position_2025 +]** and border permission pressure of **[+
border_permission_pressure +]/100**. The current operational doctrine is **[+
border_doctrine +]**.

- @hate_reporting
- @hate_prosecution
- @hate_opposition_bill
- @hate_joint_doctrine
- @hate_denial

