The legal trigger was **[+ snap_election_trigger +]**. The outgoing cabinet
now serves in a caretaker role. Ballots are counted only after a campaign month
has passed. [? if snap_campaign_beyond_horizon: Because dissolution occurred
in December 2026, polling day falls beyond the playable horizon and the final
assessment will record an election in progress rather than invent a same-day
result.?]

